# wc(1)

## NAME

wc - count lines, words and bytes

## SYNOPSIS

    wc [-lwc] [file...]

## DESCRIPTION

Writes the number of lines, words and bytes of each file (or standard input). With two or more files, a total follows.

## OPTIONS

- `-l`: lines
- `-w`: words
- `-c`: bytes

## EXIT STATUS

- `0`: success
- `1`: an error occurred for some operand
- `2`: usage error

